    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Circuit</strong> <strong>is a\u00a0first-person exploration and stealth game about urban trespass and the stories buried beneath forgotten structures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kalen, a lone urban explorer drawn to the silence of abandoned industrial sites. These are places no one talks about. Towers left unfinished. Facilities evacuated without notice. Some are decades old. Some feel like everyone left yesterday. Surveillance systems still hum quietly in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you are just there to see what was left behind. Then you find a radio. And someone answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore large, handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb scaffolding, cross exposed beams, scale industrial structures, and navigate layered spaces built for movement and vertical discovery. Each location is designed to reward patience, observation, and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on stealth and precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take matters. Navigate unstable structures, avoid surveillance, and rely on your awareness to stay hidden. Movement is your only defense, and the environment is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive first-person traversal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move like a real explorer. Climb scaffolding, shimmy across ledges, balance on narrow beams, and pull yourself through tight spaces. The environment tests your body and your focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document a hidden story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost materials, take photos, and uncover pieces of a quiet narrative tied to a powerful corporate entity called Noventis. What connects all of these sites is not immediately clear, but the truth is scattered throughout the architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A voice on the radio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lena helps you find your way through these forgotten structures. She offers guidance, context, and insight into the places you explore and into the larger mystery that ties them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711630/extras/815654c48e242ac6114b3eba92365b29.avif?t=1749157364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Circuit is about the thrill of going where you are not supposed to and learning why no one ever came back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Community<br><strong>Wishlist now and join the Discord to follow development.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Circuit</strong> <strong>is a\u00a0first-person exploration and stealth game about urban trespass and the stories buried beneath forgotten structures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kalen, a lone urban explorer drawn to the silence of abandoned industrial sites. These are places no one talks about. Towers left unfinished. Facilities evacuated without notice. Some are decades old. Some feel like everyone left yesterday. Surveillance systems still hum quietly in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you are just there to see what was left behind. Then you find a radio. And someone answers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore large, handcrafted environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb scaffolding, cross exposed beams, scale industrial structures, and navigate layered spaces built for movement and vertical discovery. Each location is designed to reward patience, observation, and curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on stealth and precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take matters. Navigate unstable structures, avoid surveillance, and rely on your awareness to stay hidden. Movement is your only defense, and the environment is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive first-person traversal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move like a real explorer. Climb scaffolding, shimmy across ledges, balance on narrow beams, and pull yourself through tight spaces. The environment tests your body and your focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document a hidden story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lost materials, take photos, and uncover pieces of a quiet narrative tied to a powerful corporate entity called Noventis. What connects all of these sites is not immediately clear, but the truth is scattered throughout the architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A voice on the radio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lena helps you find your way through these forgotten structures. She offers guidance, context, and insight into the places you explore and into the larger mystery that ties them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711630/extras/815654c48e242ac6114b3eba92365b29.avif?t=1749157364\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Circuit is about the thrill of going where you are not supposed to and learning why no one ever came back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Community<br><strong>Wishlist now and join the Discord to follow development.</strong></p>",
